    <summary>Design, apply and batch-export watermarks on photos and PDFs, with smart placement and a watermark protection score.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[PixelMark batch watermarks whole folders of photos and multi-page PDFs locally on your PC. Smart placement suggests the hardest spot to crop out, and a Protection Score gauges removal difficulty. Features Brand Kits and EXIF/GPS scrubbing.

Licensing: PixelMark is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£9.99 one-time purchase, 12 months of updates included, online activation required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=pixelmark.]]></description>
